:: Hello [NPC:Ellie]
Oh! A traveller. Hello, {PlayerName}! I'm Ellie.
I'm fixing up my little workshop, but I've run out of wood. Could you bring me 10 softwood logs?
[[Of course!|Accept]]
[[Not right now.|Later]]
[[Got anything for me?|Gifts]]
[[I want to RESPEC myself.|Respec]]

:: Accept [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "start ellie_errands")
Wonderful! The trees around here give good softwood. Come back when you have 10 logs.

:: Later [NPC:Ellie]
No worries. I'll be right here if you change your mind.

:: WoodWait [NPC:Ellie]
Any luck with the wood? I still need 10 softwood logs.
[[I'll keep looking.|Bye]]
[[Got anything for me?|Gifts]]
[[I want to RESPEC myself.|Respec]]

:: WoodReady [NPC:Ellie]
Are those softwood logs? You found them!
[[Here's your wood.|WoodGive]]
[[Not yet, I need them.|Bye]]

:: WoodGive [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "give ellie_errands")
Wonderful! Put them in my box, then press Give.
[[Let me look...|END]]

:: WoodThanks [NPC:Ellie]
(set: $just_gave to false)
Perfect, thank you! One more thing... my old blade snapped in half. Could you find me a sword? Any sword will do.
[[I'll find one.|Bye]]

:: GiveFailed [NPC:Ellie]
(set: $give_failed to false)
Hmm, that's not quite what I asked for. I've put it all back in your bag.
[[Right.|Bye]]

:: SwordWait [NPC:Ellie]
Found a sword yet? Any kind will do, really.
[[Still looking.|Bye]]
[[Got anything for me?|Gifts]]
[[I want to RESPEC myself.|Respec]]

:: SwordReady [NPC:Ellie]
Is that a sword? Could I have it?
[[Here, take it.|SwordGive]]
[[Sorry, I need this one.|Bye]]

:: SwordGive [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "give ellie_errands")
Oh, thank you! Put it in my box, then press Give.
[[Let me look...|END]]

:: Reward [NPC:Ellie]
(set: $just_gave to false)
It's perfect! Here, this is for you. You've been a real help, {PlayerName}.

:: Thanks [NPC:Ellie]
My workshop is coming along nicely, thanks to you, {PlayerName}!
[[Got anything for me?|Gifts]]
[[I want to RESPEC myself.|Respec]]
[[Bye!|Bye]]

:: Gifts [NPC:Ellie]
I've got a few odds and ends lying around the workshop. What would you like?
[[A chicken to keep me company.|GiftChicken]]
(if: $has_pet)[[I'd like to give my pet back.|ReturnPet]]
[[The Staff of Clucking.|GiftClucking]]
[[The Staff of the Risen.|GiftRisen]]
[[The Hunter's Hook.|GiftHook]]
[[Never mind.|Bye]]

:: GiftChicken [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command pet on")
(trigger: "command pet new chicken")
Here, this one's the friendliest of the lot. Look after it!
[[Anything else?|Gifts]]
[[Thanks, Ellie!|Bye]]

:: ReturnPet [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command pet release")
Oh, all right. Come here, little one... I'll take good care of it. You can always come back for a chicken.
[[Anything else?|Gifts]]
[[Bye!|Bye]]

:: GiftClucking [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command clucking")
The Staff of Clucking! Right-click calls up a battle chicken. Don't ask where they come from.
[[Anything else?|Gifts]]
[[Thanks, Ellie!|Bye]]

:: GiftRisen [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command risen")
The Staff of the Risen. Creatures that fall near you will get back up and fight for you. Spooky, isn't it?
[[Anything else?|Gifts]]
[[Thanks, Ellie!|Bye]]

:: GiftHook [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command hook")
The Hunter's Hook! Throw it and the first thing it catches gets dragged right to you. Try not to hook the chickens.
[[Anything else?|Gifts]]
[[Thanks, Ellie!|Bye]]

:: Respec [NPC:Ellie]
Start over? I can loosen up everything you've learned, and every point you've put into your stats will be yours to spend again. Are you sure?
[[Yes, RESPEC me.|RespecDone]]
[[No, never mind.|Bye]]

:: RespecDone [NPC:Ellie]
(trigger: "command respec")
There! Shake it out... feel lighter? Open your character screen and spend your points however you like.
[[Thanks, Ellie!|Bye]]

:: Bye [NPC:Ellie]
See you soon, {PlayerName}.
